## Story Description
Add semantic CSS custom properties and Tailwind colour aliases to establish a consistent visual language. Add opportunity (emerald-500 #10b981), risk (rose-500 #f43f5e), and attention (amber-500 #f59e0b) semantic colours plus a SEMANTIC_COLORS constant for chart usage. Increase all dashboard page title sizes from text-xl to text-2xl font-bold. Add a .section-header utility class for chart section titles.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: frontend/src/index.css — inside :root add: --color-opportunity: #10b981; --color-risk: #f43f5e; --color-attention: #f59e0b; --color-neutral: #64748b
- Edit file: frontend/src/index.css — inside @layer utilities add: .section-header { @apply text-sm font-semibold border-l-2 border-primary pl-2 mb-3; }
- Edit file: frontend/tailwind.config.js — in theme.extend.colors add: opportunity: '#10b981', risk: '#f43f5e', attention: '#f59e0b' so that bg-opportunity, text-risk, border-attention utility classes resolve without error
- Edit file: frontend/src/components/charts/constants.ts — add export const SEMANTIC_COLORS = { opportunity: '#10b981', risk: '#f43f5e', attention: '#f59e0b', neutral: '#64748b' } after the existing CHART_COLORS
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/OverviewPage.tsx — change h1 className from 'text-xl font-semibold' to 'text-2xl font-bold'
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/CategoryPage.tsx — same h1 change to 'text-2xl font-bold'
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/SupplierPage.tsx — same h1 change to 'text-2xl font-bold'
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/PaymentTermsPage.tsx — same h1 change to 'text-2xl font-bold'
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/DataQualityPage.tsx — same h1 change to 'text-2xl font-bold'
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/RecommendationsPage.tsx — same h1 change to 'text-2xl font-bold'
- Run: cd frontend && npm run build — should succeed with zero TypeScript errors

